sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant HA as HA Proxy
    participant M1 as Master (old)
    participant R1 as Replica 1
    participant R2 as Replica 2

    Client->>HA: Requests
    HA->>M1: Write requests
    M1->>R1: Replication
    M1->>R2: Replication
    HA->>R1: Read requests
    HA->>R2: Read requests

    Note over R2: 1. Upgrade Replica 2

    Note over R1: 2. Upgrade Replica 1

    Note over M1,R1: 3. Failover to Replica 1
    R1->>M1: Becomes new master
    M1->>R1: Becomes replica

    Note over M1: 4. Upgrade old master